# Project Structure Guide

The plugin entry point is [foodxpress-for-woocommerce.php](mdc:foodxpress-for-woocommerce.php).

• Business logic classes live in the [includes](mdc:includes/) directory, one class per file prefixed `class-fxw-`.
• UI assets: [assets/css](mdc:assets/css/) for styles and [assets/js](mdc:assets/js/) for JavaScript.
• Public-facing templates are in [templates](mdc:templates/).
• Tests (PHPUnit, Playwright, etc.) are all under [tests](mdc:tests/).

When searching:
1. Admin bar, dashboard, roles, settings: matching class files in `includes/`.
2. Checkout, shipping, orders: `class-fxw-checkout.php`, `class-fxw-shipping-method.php`, `class-fxw-order-*`.
3. Services and helpers: `includes/services/`.